return {
    ["        很久没有再写日记了，在这个黑暗的陵寝中，在疯狂与污染交织的缝隙里，清醒是困难的。\n        回首这一生，我从一个普通的穿越者，变成了改变世界的大帝。我发明了蒸汽机，建立了共和国，征服了海洋，书写了法律……但我也失去了太多——我的故乡，我的平凡，我的孩子们的爱，还有……我自己。\n        黄涛，你还记得吗？那个在地球上熬夜看小说、打游戏、抱怨工作的普通青年？那个想念妈妈做的红烧肉、想念和朋友撸串吹牛的普通人？有时候我觉得自己好像做了一个很长的梦，梦里我成为了无所不能的大帝，但醒来时，我只"] = "        It has been a long time since I last wrote in my diary. In this dark mausoleum, in the gaps where madness and corruption intertwine, staying clear-headed is difficult.\n        Looking back on this life, I went from an ordinary transmigrator to an Emperor who changed the world. I invented the steam engine, established the republic, conquered the oceans, and wrote the laws... but I also lost too much—my homeland, my ordinariness, the love of my children, and... myself.\n        Huang Tao, do you still remember? That ordinary young man on Earth who stayed up late reading novels, playing games, and complaining about work? That ordinary person who missed his mother's braised pork, missed hanging out with friends, eating skewers, and bragging? Sometimes I feel like I had a very long dream, in which I became an omnipotent Emperor, but when I wake up, I only",
    ["1.立旗后我方进度初始为满，站在<Highlight>旗帜范围内</>的我方成员将根据存活时间持续获得积分。\n2.此外，<Highlight>击败或助攻击败非凡者</>同样可获得积分。\n3.宣战时间结束后，<Highlight>积分高的一方获胜</>。积分相同时，<Highlight>被宣战方</>获胜。当一方积分大于另一方积分超过5000时，则积分高的一方直接获胜。\n4.当敌方进入旗帜范围内，且<Highlight>敌方人数多于我方</>时，进度条将逐渐变为敌方进度。"] = "1. After planting the flag, our progress is initially full, and our members standing <Highlight> within the flag's range </> will continuously gain points based on their survival time. \n 2. In addition, <Highlight> defeating or assisting in defeating Beyonders </> can also earn points. \n 3. After the declaration time ends, <Highlight> the side with more points wins </>. If the points are the same, <Highlight> the side that was declared against </> wins. When one side's points exceed the other's by more than 5000, the side with more points wins directly. \n 4. When the enemy enters the flag's range and <Highlight> the number of enemies is greater than ours </>, the progress bar will gradually change to the enemy's progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【众神之巅】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>众神之巅</>是以战队形式参加的<Assistant_Red>6对6组队赛事</>。赛场使用玩家真实属性，<Assistant_Property1>装备</>、<Assistant_Property1>封印物</>、<Assistant_Property1>秘偶</>、<Assistant_Property1>人脉</>、<Assistant_Property1>天赋系统效果</>均可生效。\n<Assistant_Title2>战队规则：</>战队成员上限为<Assistant_Red>6人</>，同职业人数不超过<Assistant_Red>2人</>。比赛报名开启后，玩家可以组建或加入战队；战队成员达到<Assistant_Red>5名</>后即可报名。已报名战队若成员变动导致人数小于5名，会自动取消报名。\n<Assistant_Title2>锁定规则：</>锁定报名期间，已报名战队可以进入准备场地；未报名战队仍可报名，玩家也可以加入战队，但不能主动离开或被队长请离，已报名战队也不允许取消报名。比赛正式开始后，需要停留在准备场地，以保证正常进入比赛。\n<Assistant_Title2>赛制规则：</>小组赛阶段每轮随机匹配对手进行单局比赛，共进行<Assistant_Red>6轮</>，根据胜场数选出<Assistant_Red>16支队伍</>晋级；胜场数相同时，根据荣耀值决定晋级者，荣耀值参考击杀数、战斗时长。小组赛结束后进入助力阶段，淘汰赛开始前根据助力值与荣耀值总和确定淘汰赛位次。淘汰赛阶段为<Assistant_Red>三局两胜</>，决赛为<Assistant_Red>五局三胜</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往众神之巅]|1250113}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Peak of the Gods】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </><Assistant_System>Peak of the Gods</> is a <Assistant_Red>6v6 team tournament</> participated in by teams. The arena uses the player's real attributes, and <Assistant_Property1>Equipment</>, <Assistant_Property1>Sealed Artifacts</>, <Assistant_Property1>marionettes</>, <Assistant_Property1>Connections</>, and <Assistant_Property1>Talent System effects</> all take effect.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Rules: </>The team member limit is <Assistant_Red>6 people</>, with no more than <Assistant_Red>2 people</> of the same profession. After tournament registration opens, players can form or join a team; once a team reaches <Assistant_Red>5 members</>, they can register. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Lock Rules: </>During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area; unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the captain, and registered teams are not allowed to cancel registration. After the match officially begins, you must stay in the preparation area to ensure normal entry into the match.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tournament Rules: </>In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for single-game matches each round, for a total of <Assistant_Red>6 rounds</>. <Assistant_Red>16 teams</> are selected to advance based on the number of wins; if the number of wins is the same, advancement is determined by Glory Value, which references kills and combat duration. After the group stage, the assistance phase begins, and the knockout stage seeding is determined based on the sum of Assistance Value and Glory Value before the knockout stage begins. The knockout stage is <Assistant_Red>best-of-three</>, and the finals are <Assistant_Red>best-of-five</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Peak of the Gods]|1250113}",
